<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="zh">
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
    <title>请先建档</title>
    <style>
      * { box-sizing: border-box; }
      body { font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, "Segoe UI", sans-serif; background: #f5f6f8; margin: 0; color: #1f2937; }
      .bar { background: #1f2937; color: #fff; padding: 0 24px; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 28px; height: 54px; }
      .brand { color: #fff; text-decoration: none; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; }
      .nav { display: flex; gap: 4px; flex: 1; }
      .nav-link { color: #cbd5e1; text-decoration: none; padding: 6px 12px; border-radius: 6px; font-size: 14px; }
      .nav-link.on { color: #fff; background: #2563eb; }
      .wrap { max-width: 560px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 60px 20px; }
      .box { background: #fff; border-radius: 12px; padding: 40px 44px; box-shadow: 0 1px 6px rgba(0,0,0,.06); text-align: center; }
      .box h1 { margin: 0 0 10px; font-size: 19px; }
      .box p { color: #6b7280; margin: 0 0 8px; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.7; }
      .btn { display: inline-block; padding: 10px 22px; border-radius: 6px; text-decoration: none; font-size: 14px; margin-top: 18px; }
      .btn-primary { background: #2563eb; color: #fff; }
      .btn-ghost { background: #f3f4f6; color: #374151; margin-left: 8px; }
    </style>
  </head>
  <body>
    <%- include("partials/nav", { active: "demand" }) %>

    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="box">
        <h1>还没有客户档案</h1>
        <p>需求登记必须挂在一个客户档案下，所以要先建档。</p>
        <p>建好档案后回到这里，就能为它登记需求了。</p>
        <a class="btn btn-primary" href="/profiles/new">去建第一份档案</a>
        <a class="btn btn-ghost" href="/">返回需求列表</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </body>
</html>